  {
   "id": "tavern-manager-simulator-290509@major-2025-08-13",
   "gameId": "tavern-manager-simulator-290509",
   "displayName": "KING & CONCERTS UPDATE",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-08-13T16:02:36.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This is our biggest update yet, celebrating the game's anniversary! We've added 4 new tavern levels and new mechanics!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎶Musicians and Concerts",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "What's a tavern without bards? Hire musicians and organize concerts in your tavern. Let your patrons dance!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44820925/7df8a49461598fe399c80d6489d37f8edba02a8d.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "👑Long Live the King!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The King himself may visit your tavern. Organize a grand feast for him, and perhaps he'll decide that your tavern is the best in the entire kingdom.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44820925/9684524e0c65a3825f65e1d8b5df222174d57793.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🏺Artifact Display Cases and Magic Flowers",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Put your artifacts on public display for all patrons to admire. And if you want to speed up your fairies, use the flowers they love so much.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44820925/27bccf88237e9d2760b1ab5bda801572bd9daf88.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "---",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🧚‍♀️ A fairy concierge will take care of the hotel",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🏨 The hotel can be closed, and the hall can be decorated",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🪓 Axe upgrades will make chopping wood easier",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🛠️New decorations like railings and small stairs will allow you to beautifully partition tables",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "👁️‍🗨️ A spotter will notify you of an approaching thief",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "💰 The loan size increases with your reputation level",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🖼️ Lots of new decorations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🏆Extended level progression with rewards if you choose to play after completing the main storyline",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "---",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🤔 Sometimes patrons would stand up but not leave",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🧼 Wiping stains is no longer laggy, and there are more types of stains",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎵 Sometimes the music wouldn't start playing immediately when the game launched",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🧚‍♀️ Sometimes the fairies would forget about the soup",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🌫️ Less windy and foggy weather, reduced lightning brightness, quieter wind",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🌧️ Rain and fog should not appear inside the building",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "💬 Sometimes it was possible to get stuck in a dialogue by clicking on characters too quickly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "📌Interactive decor is now marked with a special icon in the inventory and shop",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✉️ The letter is removed after catching the goblin",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🍔 Characters now hold food better",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Return to the tavern and build the Best Tavern Ever!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🎉 Announcement: Anime Shop Simulator",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you want to support us, then add our next game to your wishlist - a co-op anime shop simulator",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Manage your own anime shop . Play solo or team up with friends in 4-player co-op mode to grow your business. Stock shelves with manga, figures, and collectible cards in this immersive first-person game 🕹️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3393280?utm_source=news_english/\"]or buy a DLC with unique tavern signs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3387950/Tavern_Manager_Simulator_Supporter_Pack_DLC/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
