  {
   "id": "tavern-manager-simulator-290509@major-2025-03-01",
   "gameId": "tavern-manager-simulator-290509",
   "displayName": "Big Update: Hotel is here!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-03-01T15:33:08.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "🏨 UPDATE: HOTEL 🏨",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We've been preparing for this moment for a long time and finally added a BIG construction site! Now your guests have a place to relax after a delicious lunch - meet the HOTEL! You will have to greet guests, clean the rooms and keep things cozy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "But first, the hotel needs to be built, and a team of highly skilled goblins will help you with this. Don't worry - they will NOT steal your sausage!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The hotel becomes available from level 11.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Other Important Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "💧 Water Supply Updates",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New upgrades for the well and water supply system.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ability to store water and collect it in the new water pump.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Water reserves in the kitchen to spend less time refilling it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "💰 Price Controller",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now you can adjust the prices of dishes!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "More visitors or a calm atmosphere? Choose the balance that suits you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🆘 New button \"Help, item stuck!\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "If an item has fallen through the floor or is stuck after an upgrade, solve the problem right in the pause menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🧚 Flexible customization of fairy waitresses",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Determine which halls they work in.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Choose whether they will do cleaning.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Set their priorities so that the work is more efficient!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Fixes and minor improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Visitors no longer get stuck near the toilet.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fairies now have cute wings and work magic while working.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the VIP hall, the screens have become lower - orders are now visible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "NPC walking animations play correctly even if you slightly... hit them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The update is now available! Thank you for playing! ❤️",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "If you want to support us, then add our next game to your wishlist - a co-op anime shop simulator",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "or buy a DLC with unique tavern signs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
